  "query": "CellRank 输出了一组与某条 lineage fate probability 相关的基因。下面拟写的结论是否与证据强度相符？请给出可接受措辞；不要执行。\n\n已提供的条件（未提供的值不作推断）：\nindependent_intervention=none\nproposed_conclusion=These are lineage-correlated candidate driver genes\nRetrieval hints: canonical task: trajectory inference; explicit tool: CellRank; claim: returned output stored artifact embedding obsm coordinates labels; claim: benchmark dataset rank scope; claim: metric evaluation definition",
