          "statement": "The source describes a Markov-state-modeling framework and explicitly lists fate-probability inference. No RNA-velocity-only requirement is inferred for CellRank 2. ; CellRank 2 retains probabilistic cell-fate mapping while accepting multiple data views; this agrees with the family's earlier general capability without implying identical prerequisites. ; CellRank estimates probabilistic cell fates from directed transitions. This is a scientific family capability, not proof of every proposed biological lineage. ; CellRank estimators use transition matrices to infer fates. The different kernel input modalities remain alternatives, not a mandatory RNA-velocity prerequisite.",
